#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a compilation of the most frequently asked questions about the K "
"Desktop Environment. Please report any bugs, inconsistencies, or omissions "
"you find in this &FAQ; to <email>kde-doc-english@kde.org</email>. Please do "
"not mail your questions to this list. Post them to the &kde; mailing lists "
"and newsgroups instead. They are monitored for this &FAQ;."
